2,26],[31617,16.8,2020,56,148,26],[31618,17.0,2020,58,139,27]],"links":[["Sioux County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/sioux-county"],["ARC or PLC in Sioux County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/sioux-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. The middle of the grids ran wet in 2025, with September to October at 232% of normal. So far in 2026 every published pair has come in under 90%, with June to July at 58% on the middle of the grids. Grid 31015 had its driest year in 2002 at 50%.</p>"}
